      "title": "Letterboxd review of The Taste of Tea",
      "snippet": "[Letterboxd Review of \"The Taste of Tea\"] ★ Gonzo's Top 200 Favorite Films of All TimeThe girl just wants to do a back flip on the horizontal bar so that she could get rid of that giant version of herself that keeps watching her. Who can't relate to that?I know quirky, absurdist humor isn't everybody's cup of tea (pun intended), but if you're thinking of dipping your toes into the weird (and wonderful) side of comedy, this film would make a great introduction as there's just something irresistibly enchanting and endearing about it.Equal parts thoughtful and bonkers, The Taste of Tea is like Ozu on crack. You need this in your life.♪ Y",
      "link": "https://letterboxd.com/film/the-taste-of-tea/"
    },
